[/dim]bob-cli-k6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-k6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Always-on SVG image guard[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]svg-image-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]svg-image-guard: add an always-on Lua image filter that swaps SVG embeds[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for a same-stem sibling raster or an Image-not-printable placeholder, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reports them as images:/warning: lines, fixes the misleading svg.sty [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hint, and documents the behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vector SVG rendering through the Chrome diagram renderer[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]svg-vector-render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after svg-image-guard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]svg-vector-render: extend the Mermaid diagram pass and adapter protocol [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]so local SVG embeds render to vector PDFs in the same browser launch, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]falling back to the guard, then optionally recapture the failed report.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-k6","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-k6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-84289408d3242c861f18bf5483c1a830","started_at":"2026-11-11T12:55:29.008527+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1794408346,"sha":"7eb82440731f94ffc65177b1ab94a2fa708bd447","subject":"feat(highlights): render local SVG embeds as vector PDFs"}],"dismissed_at":null,"file